<title>TOGO: SOCCER-CAMEROON BEAT TOGO 4-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CAMEROON BEAT TOGO 4-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LOME 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cameroon beat Togo 4-2 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) on Sunday in their African zone group four World Cup</p>
<p>qualifying match.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cameroon - Alphonse Tchami 18, 30, Patrick Mboma 53, Vincent</p>
<p>Misse-Misse 68</p>
<p>Togo  Franck Fiawoo 51,Salou Tadjou 83 penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
